{"ticker":"FDX","updated":"2026-11-13T23:22:34Z","profile":{"longName":"FedEx Corporation","shortName":"FedEx Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","country":"United States","website":"https://www.fedex.com","fullTimeEmployees":300000,"marketCap":75913388032,"trailingPE":17.473856,"forwardPE":15.4881935,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.8014505,"pegRatio":1.98,"targetMeanPrice":356.6154,"targetHighPrice":479.0,"targetLowPrice":160.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.119,"earningsGrowth":-0.689,"grossMargins":0.27318,"operatingMargins":0.07892,"profitMargins":0.0468,"totalRevenue":94720000000,"beta":1.314,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":345.37,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":209.33925,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.53},"summary":"FedEx Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides transportation, e-commerce, and business services in the United States and internationally. The company operates through two segments, Express U.S. Domestic and Express International. It provides e-commerce and digital solutions; dataworks; printing and shipping management, including digital printing, professional finishing, document creation, design solutions, direct mail, signs and graphics, custom-branded boxes, copying, computer rental, Wi-Fi, corporate print solutions, shredding, U.S. passport processing and renewal, and digital notarization; packing services, as well as packing supplies and boxes; document and business services; and retail access for package transportation. In addition, the company offers logistics services, air and ocean cargo transportation, specialty transportation, customs brokerage, trade management tools and data, and door-to-door solutions; and third party logistics and supply chain management solutions, such as inbound logistics, warehousing and distribution, fulfillment, contract packaging and product configuration, systems integration, returns process and disposition, test, repair, refurbishment, and product liquidation. Further, it provides sales, marketing, administrative, information technology, and back-office support services. FedEx Corporation was founded in 1971 and is headquarte","summary_zh":"聯邦快遞公司及其子公司在美國和國際上提供運輸、電子商務和商業服務。該公司透過兩個部門運作：美國國內快遞部門和國際快遞部門。它提供電子商務和數位解決方案；數據工作；印刷和運輸管理，包括數位印刷、專業裝訂、文件創建、設計解決方案、直郵、標誌和圖形、定製品牌包裝盒、影印、電腦租賃、Wi-Fi、企業列印解決方案、碎紙、美國護照處理和更新以及數位公證；包裝服務以及包裝用品和盒子；文件和商業服務；以及包裹運輸的零售渠道。此外，該公司還提供物流服務、空運和海運、特殊運輸、報關、貿易管理工具和數據以及門到門解決方案；第三方物流和供應鏈管理解決方案，例如入庫物流、倉儲和配送、履行、合約包裝和產品配置、系統整合、退貨流程和處置、測試、維修、翻新和產品清算。此外，它還提供銷售、行銷、行政、資訊科技和後台支援服務。聯邦快遞公司成立於 1971 年，總部","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"綜合貨運及物流","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":186.7204,"h":187.4214,"l":181.8372,"c":181.8614,"v":2670012},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":184.3594,"h":185.3344,"l":181.9823,"c":183.4811,"v":2275622},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":181.7244,"h":187.6471,"l":180.7977,"c":181.9339,"v":3876015},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":183.6261,"h":184.6092,"l":181.1281,"c":182.5141,"v":7910258},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":183.9645,"h":189.6213,"l":181.4988,"c":186.7446,"v":10410004},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":185.3425,"h":186.1402,"l":181.668,"c":185.4311,"v":4778595},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":185.8662,"h":190.0322,"l":185.6567,"c":188.3159,"v":3573708},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":187.9533,"h":190.0725,"l":187.9371,"c":188.3562,"v":2093567},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":188.0338,"h":190.7494,"l":187.3489,"c":190.5077,"v":2195081},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":190.975,"h":195.004,"l":189.0653,"c":191.6358,"v":2852066},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":192.6189,"h":192.9251,"l":188.8396,"c":190.6366,"v":1618885},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":189.3876,"h":190.1048,"l":186.8654,"c":190.0161,"v":1792128},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":189.3715,"h":193.5939,"l":188.7994,"c":193.0298,"v":1777608},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":193.2554,"h":197.7276,"l":192.5866,"c":195.2619,"v":2185773},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":195.8743,"h":197.9533,"l":195.6164,"c":197.1072,"v":2158595},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":197.22,"h":201.523,"l":196.3014,"c":199.0572,"v":2524690},{"t"